{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f7610a27f2616f1d7b5def00f442856c35abc8c1d45c7c2958fe9d569eda06a2", "ja": "（765PRO ALLSTARSライブ前夜。\n前乗りして行われたリハーサルが一通り終了した）", "zh": "（765PRO ALLSTARS演唱会前夜。提前到场进行的彩排全部结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "97772436d6d4e84111134680ca63b06d7d6426618f317c6677aca093c93964b6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nリハーサル、お疲れ様でした！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n排练辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1002_p", "source_sha256": "025baf35de855cdbaa910fa66f87fb20a3840e7ca3cc7b13e8f81977c11d240e", "ja": "お疲れ様。\n戻りが遅かったけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n你回来得有点晚，是遇到什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "1d8bcbd7ad6ff13bbc1fb646fd1fe8734f2cc1df5d88b845abaae178cd6b1819", "ja": "あ、すみません！　ちょっと……\n客席を見て回ってたんです。", "zh": "啊，对不起！只是稍微……去观众席转了一圈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "9a446e4870695c5778f7ace90459db00bbdb8b9750d529b060e0cfde185296f2", "ja": "明日になったら、そんな余裕はないと思って。\nステージを眺めたり、席に座ってみたりして……。", "zh": "我想，等到了明天，应该就没有这样的余裕了。  \n所以就看看舞台，坐到座位上试了试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "ab097a934f5fdddce35361372858357afe0f7c23e60ea9080c5524b7a1130bea", "ja": "気が付いたら、\n一番後ろの席まで行っちゃってました。", "zh": "回过神来，已经走到最后一排的座位了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5b9d2d057f2ef8aff999191f8e78f1c9ae6eae47d1145b65c9fa715f227d809f", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nお客さんには、楽しんでもらえそうだったか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n客人们应该都能看得尽兴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "c4cc8e5fb2fac87fb8eaaa11918feead00473a8224a2178def2bff0b56d93ec1", "ja": "はい、どこの席からもステージはよく見えました♪\nただ、どうしても私達、小さくなりそうですけど……。", "zh": "是的，从哪个座位都能清楚地看到舞台♪\n不过，我们无论如何都好像会变得很小……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d0870f5a4f0cd752686ae7a452aef40c9127c3923878922bd42f5a1adf18ce3f", "ja": "そうだな。できることなら、お客さんみんなに\n最前列で見てほしいんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊。可以的话，我真希望每位客人都能坐在最前排观看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "ea19bb2d2dd1fd8857a0f526e0c7235aabc78d1226d43cbc757145e6b6a4b1b8", "ja": "あっ、もちろんそれは仕方ないって思ってます！\nでもだからこそ、一番後ろの人たちに……。ううん。", "zh": "啊，当然，我也觉得那是没办法的事！\n但正因为如此，我更想让坐在最后面的大家……不，没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "de48b6d6253f8ff6e0a33d04b201facb80b5879038982336b678feb29e5e0dc2", "ja": "どこのどんな席にいても、私達をすぐ近くに感じて、\nみんな笑顔になれる……そんなライブにしたいです！", "zh": "无论坐在会场的哪个位置、什么样的座位上，都能感觉我们近在身边，让大家绽放笑容……我想举办一场这样的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1011_p", "source_sha256": "842db27be3c3b41a106cee33412d7b6dfec41a282d5ac91233529730fbe7417c", "ja": "ああ。会場にいる人も、画面の向こう側にいる人も\n一緒に泣いて笑って、夢中になるライブにしよう。", "zh": "啊。无论是在会场里，还是在屏幕另一端，\n都一起欢笑流泪、沉浸其中，办一场让大家着迷的演唱会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "875db05240c6e3fb6956506d7fcac0c1f2d025d75ce3b298920f4f27c6a1234d", "ja": "はい！　夢中になれて、笑顔になれて、\n元気になれる……そんなライブにしてみせます。", "zh": "好的！我一定会办成一场让大家全情投入、绽放笑容、充满活力的演唱会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "df1621c312f5ca26231a85ed3cc4ffe499df640d97742b10a1724aaeada25ee8", "ja": "だって私は、アイドルですから！\n……なーんて。えへへっ♪", "zh": "因为，我可是偶像啊！\n……开玩笑的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8357d3a0410616b367d507700a8871ffec143a467c7db43fa3346fc6bc7be643", "ja": "春香……。", "zh": "春香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "ec8a182d31184fe79e6fc592f0a017dd46349031522e51b24c45e4ed48ffd475", "ja": "ああっ！　そのためにも、今夜は早く寝なくちゃ\nいけないんでした！　あの、急いで着替えてきますね！", "zh": "啊！所以今晚也得早点睡才行！那个，我马上去换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0533_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "80fb18cabf7c7ec08e7f908457004b8a90d7dcdc8bb0f343673743f1010812a3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おやすみなさー……\nあっ、っと、きゃああああっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，晚安——……\n啊，哇，呀啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
